{"reviewId": "932360059_8cPv7pGDc", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "我靠鸡皮疙瘩起来了，八字里所有人的第六个大运都算是一个坎，因为第六部大运对月柱天克地冲，月柱是事业宫，也代表原生家庭，有的人一冲就死了，有的人冲发了，我看了六百多个案例，有一些人连续三十年平运三十年好运，而也有一些人三十年平运三十年衰运，还有一部分人是自死运开始小时候二十年衰运，中间二十年好运，到第六部大运就死了", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "1189-1216", "abstract": "一个人出生在康波中的时点几乎就注定了其一生的经济轨迹。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "932360059_8cPv7pGDc", "userVid": 932360059, "topics": [], "createTime": 1791905541, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 932360059, "name": "Bella", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKnCKkeZZcCJctHaNstOlq0WEBiblm8mETcXbrVMgwA8NbRcAnwGT4rM35J0q2cdg5gfPOg0afbOyJDb7rkbyJgomNeuha6zHQXqn1cQqBiaJLA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "我一定可以", "medalInfo": {"id": "M11-0-5", "desc": "点评书籍", "title": "点评书籍", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 928510047, "name": "bbudingggg🍮", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-A1xTNcUZ24w44da8_1Jdi10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "bbudingggg🍮", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "胡乱阅读一级专家", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "求教，请问书友案例在哪看的呀～一直对八字很感兴趣，但没找到很